# Animations and transforms

Use `transition` to smooth state changes, and `animation` with `@keyframes` for continuous effects. Multiple animations can run together, and animation events can drive later interface updates.

## Play multiple animations together

```css
.status {
  animation: fade-in 300ms ease-out, pulse 900ms ease-in-out infinite;
  transition: background-color 200ms ease;
}
@keyframes fade-in {
  from { opacity: 0; }
  to { opacity: 1; }
}
@keyframes pulse {
  from { transform: scale(1); }
  50% { transform: scale(1.05); }
  to { transform: scale(1); }
}
```

Comma-separated animations have independent timing. Shorter duration, delay, and related lists repeat their values; values beyond the animation-name count are ignored. Later contributing animations win for a shared property. Active transitions override keyframe values, and ordinary `!important` declarations can override keyframes.

Unrelated `setData()` or style updates do not restart animations. Removing and re-adding an animation starts a new playback. Completed `forwards` / `both` animations retain their final effect without continuing to request frames.

## Listen for animation events

```xml
<view class="status" bindanimationstart="onAnimation"
  bindanimationiteration="onAnimation" bindanimationend="onAnimation"
  bindanimationcancel="onAnimation" />
```

```javascript
export default {
  onAnimation(event) {
    console.log(event.type, event.animationName, event.elapsedTime, event.pseudoElement);
    if (event.type === 'animationend') {
      this.setData({ completed: true });
    }
  },
};
```

Events bubble through ancestors to the Page / Widget. Use `bind`, `catch`, `addEventListener()`, or the matching `onanimation...` property. `stopPropagation()` stops bubbling; animation events are not cancelable. `elapsedTime` is in seconds, excluding delay; `pseudoElement` is `''`, `'::before'`, or `'::after'`. `detail` also contains these three animation fields.

Removing an animation or node, or setting `display: none`, cancels active playback and fires `animationcancel` once. Closing a Page / Widget fires cancellation before `onUnload` / `onDestroy`. Offscreen pauses and temporarily hidden pages preserve progress.

## Replay decorations when text changes

```xml
<text class="streaming-text">{{answer}}</text>
```

```css
.streaming-text {
  position: relative;
  event-trigger: --text-update textchange;
}
.streaming-text::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 100%;
  top: 50%;
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background-color: #74f7c5;
  animation: spark 900ms ease-out;
  animation-trigger: --text-update replay;
  -ink-animation-trigger-instance-limit: 5;
}
@keyframes spark {
  from { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1); }
  to { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, -28px) scale(0.35); }
}
```

`event-trigger: --name textchange` fires when the final bound text changes; `attributechange` observes changes to attribute-generated content. Initial mounting does not trigger playback. Multiple updates before one layout coalesce into one replay.

`animation-trigger: --name replay` restarts playback on the owning `<text>` element's generated pseudo-element. One instance is retained by default. The extension `-ink-animation-trigger-instance-limit` accepts integers from `1` to `32`, discarding the oldest instance at the limit. Each replay captures its anchor after layout, so later text changes do not move older effects.

This feature targets single-line `<text>`. Generated boxes animate only `transform` and `opacity` and are not queryable Entity nodes. See [Pseudo-elements](/AIUI/framework/wxss-pseudo-element) for details. To vary sizes or endpoints for each replay, use [`random()` on the functions page](/AIUI/framework/wxss-function), keeping literal fallbacks.

## Animatable properties and 2D transforms

Supports sizes and insets, margin / padding, border widths, font-size / line-height, colors, radii, background-position, visibility, opacity, and 2D transform / transform-origin. Size and typography changes require layout; prefer transform and opacity for frequent movement.

`transform` supports `matrix()`, `translate()` / X / Y, `rotate()`, `scale()` / X / Y, and `skew()` / X / Y. Independent `translate`, `rotate`, and `scale` compose in that order before `transform`:

```css
.badge {
  translate: 8px 25%;
  rotate: 0.125turn;
  scale: 120% 0.9;
  transform-origin: left center;
}
```

Keep endpoint transform types and ordering consistent. Compatible values interpolate continuously; incompatible values switch at the interval midpoint. 3D transforms, perspective, a third transform-origin component, and `animation-play-state` are unsupported. Min/max sizes, flex / grid controls, gap, shadow, filter, clip, and outline do not interpolate.

## Timing and fill

- `animation-duration` / `animation-delay` use `ms` or `s`. Negative delays are supported; durations cannot be negative.
- `animation-iteration-count` accepts counts or `infinite`; `animation-direction` accepts `normal`, `reverse`, `alternate`, or `alternate-reverse`.
- `animation-fill-mode` accepts `none`, `forwards`, `backwards`, or `both`.
- Timing functions include `linear`, the `ease` family, `cubic-bezier()`, `step-start`, `step-end`, and `steps()`. `steps(n, jump-none)` requires `n >= 2`; other steps require a positive integer.
- Zero duration or iteration count completes after the delay without continuous playback.

# 动画与变换

使用 `transition` 平滑响应状态变化，使用 `animation` 与 `@keyframes` 定义连续效果。多个动画可以同时运行，动画事件可以驱动后续界面更新。

## 同时播放多个动画

```css
.status {
  animation: fade-in 300ms ease-out, pulse 900ms ease-in-out infinite;
  transition: background-color 200ms ease;
}
@keyframes fade-in {
  from { opacity: 0; }
  to { opacity: 1; }
}
@keyframes pulse {
  from { transform: scale(1); }
  50% { transform: scale(1.05); }
  to { transform: scale(1); }
}
```

逗号分隔的动画分别计时。duration、delay 等列表不足时循环使用已有值，超出动画名称数量的值忽略。同一属性被多个动画影响时，后面的动画优先；该属性正在进行的 transition 优先于 keyframe 动画。普通声明中的 `!important` 可以覆盖 keyframe 值。

无关的 `setData()` 或样式更新不会重启动画。移除动画再重新添加会开始新播放；已结束的 `forwards` / `both` 保留最终效果，但不会持续请求动画帧。

## 监听动画事件

```xml
<view class="status" bindanimationstart="onAnimation"
  bindanimationiteration="onAnimation" bindanimationend="onAnimation"
  bindanimationcancel="onAnimation" />
```

```javascript
export default {
  onAnimation(event) {
    console.log(event.type, event.animationName, event.elapsedTime, event.pseudoElement);
    if (event.type === 'animationend') {
      this.setData({ completed: true });
    }
  },
};
```

事件会冒泡到祖先节点及 Page / Widget，支持 `bind`、`catch`、`addEventListener()` 和对应的 `onanimation...` 属性。`stopPropagation()` 可阻止冒泡；动画事件不可取消。`elapsedTime` 以秒计，不包含 delay；`pseudoElement` 为 `''`、`'::before'` 或 `'::after'`。`detail` 也提供这三个动画字段。

移除动画、节点或设置 `display: none` 会取消仍在播放的动画，派发一次 `animationcancel`。关闭 Page / Widget 时取消事件在 `onUnload` / `onDestroy` 之前触发。视口外暂停或页面暂时隐藏会保留进度。

## 文字更新时重播装饰效果

```xml
<text class="streaming-text">{{answer}}</text>
```

```css
.streaming-text {
  position: relative;
  event-trigger: --text-update textchange;
}
.streaming-text::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 100%;
  top: 50%;
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background-color: #74f7c5;
  animation: spark 900ms ease-out;
  animation-trigger: --text-update replay;
  -ink-animation-trigger-instance-limit: 5;
}
@keyframes spark {
  from { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1); }
  to { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, -28px) scale(0.35); }
}
```

`event-trigger: --name textchange` 在最终绑定文字发生变化时触发；`attributechange` 用于属性生成内容的变化。首次挂载不会触发；同一次布局前的多次更新合并为一次 replay。

`animation-trigger: --name replay` 在所属 `<text>` 的生成伪元素上从头播放。默认保留一个实例；扩展属性 `-ink-animation-trigger-instance-limit` 接受 `1` 到 `32` 的整数，达到上限后丢弃最老实例。每次播放在布局后固定起始锚点，后续文字变化不会移动旧效果。

此功能面向单行 `<text>`，生成盒子仅支持 `transform` 与 `opacity` 动画，不会成为可查询的 Entity 节点。详细边界见[伪元素](/AIUI/framework/wxss-pseudo-element)。需要让每次重播的尺寸或端点变化时，使用[函数页的 `random()`](/AIUI/framework/wxss-function)，并保留字面量回退。

## 可动画属性与 2D 变换

支持尺寸与定位、margin / padding、边框宽度、font-size / line-height、颜色、圆角、background-position、visibility、opacity，以及 2D transform / transform-origin。尺寸与排版变化会重新布局；频繁运动优先使用 transform 和 opacity。

`transform` 支持 `matrix()`、`translate()` / X / Y、`rotate()`、`scale()` / X / Y、`skew()` / X / Y。独立 `translate`、`rotate`、`scale` 按此顺序先于 `transform` 合成：

```css
.badge {
  translate: 8px 25%;
  rotate: 0.125turn;
  scale: 120% 0.9;
  transform-origin: left center;
}
```

尽量保持动画两端的变换类型与顺序相同。相容值连续插值，不相容值在区间中点切换。当前不支持 3D 变换、透视、transform-origin 的第三个分量及 `animation-play-state`。min/max 尺寸、flex / grid 控制属性、gap、shadow、filter、clip、outline 不产生插值动画。

## 时间与填充

- `animation-duration` / `animation-delay` 使用 `ms` 或 `s`，支持负 delay；duration 不能为负。
- `animation-iteration-count` 支持次数和 `infinite`；`animation-direction` 支持 `normal`、`reverse`、`alternate`、`alternate-reverse`。
- `animation-fill-mode` 支持 `none`、`forwards`、`backwards`、`both`。
- timing function 支持 `linear`、`ease` 系列、`cubic-bezier()`、`step-start`、`step-end` 和 `steps()`。`steps(n, jump-none)` 要求 `n >= 2`，其他 steps 要求正整数。
- duration 或次数为零时，在 delay 之后完成，不会持续播放。

# At-rules

At-rules are CSS statements that start with an at sign (`@`) and are used to convey special instructions to a stylesheet.

In WXSS, common at-rules and their code examples include:

## 1. `@import`
Used to import an external WXSS stylesheet. It must appear at the very top of the stylesheet.

```css
/** common.wxss **/
.flex-center {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
}

/** index.wxss **/
@import "./common.wxss";

.container {
  height: 100vh;
}
```

## 2. `@media`
Used to apply different styles based on device characteristics such as screen width, resolution, or theme.

```css
.sidebar { display: none; }
@media (min-width: 1200px) {
  .sidebar { display: block; }
}
```

## 3. `@keyframes`
Used to define a CSS animation sequence.

```css
/* 定义渐显动画 */
@keyframes fadeIn {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20rpx);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}

.card-item {
  animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease-out forwards;
}
```

## 4. `@font-face`
Used to load custom web fonts.

```css
@font-face {
  font-family: 'Bitstream Vera Serif Bold';
  src: url('https://mdn.github.io/css-examples/web-fonts/VeraSeBd.ttf');
}

.custom-text {
  font-family: 'Bitstream Vera Serif Bold', serif;
}
```

---

*For more details about at-rules, see [MDN CSS At-rules](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/At-rule).*

After `@import`, combine classes in WXML with `class="container flex-center"`; framework-specific `composes` is unsupported. See [Animations and transforms](/AIUI/framework/wxss-animation) for concurrent keyframes, events, and replay.

# @规则 (At-rules)

@规则（At-rules）是以 at 符号（`@`）开头的 CSS 语句，用于向样式表传达特殊的指令。

在 WXSS 中，常用的 @规则 及其代码示例包括：

## 1. `@import` (导入)
用于导入外联的 WXSS 样式表。必须位于样式表的最顶部。

```css
/** common.wxss **/
.flex-center {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
}

/** index.wxss **/
@import "./common.wxss";

.container {
  height: 100vh;
}
```

## 2. `@media` (媒体查询)
用于根据设备特性（如视口宽度）应用不同的样式。

```css
.sidebar { display: none; }
@media (min-width: 1200px) {
  .sidebar { display: block; }
}
```

## 3. `@keyframes` (动画关键帧)
用于定义 CSS 动画序列。

```css
/* 定义渐显动画 */
@keyframes fadeIn {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20rpx);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}

.card-item {
  animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease-out forwards;
}
```

## 4. `@font-face` (自定义字体)
用于加载自定义网络字体。

```css
@font-face {
  font-family: 'Bitstream Vera Serif Bold';
  src: url('https://mdn.github.io/css-examples/web-fonts/VeraSeBd.ttf');
}

.custom-text {
  font-family: 'Bitstream Vera Serif Bold', serif;
}
```

---

*更多 @规则 的使用详情，请参考 [MDN CSS At-rules](https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/CSS/At-rule)。*

`@import` 导入后，在 WXML 中使用 `class="container flex-center"` 组合类；不支持示例框架中的 `composes`。`@keyframes` 的并发、事件与重播说明见[动画与变换](/AIUI/framework/wxss-animation)。

# Functions

CSS functions are used as the values of CSS properties. They let you perform simple calculations, process colors, or reference external resources in stylesheets. WXSS supports the subset described below; use this page for the supported syntax.

The following are the functions most commonly used in WXSS development and their code examples:

## 1. Calculation and Variables

### `calc()`
Calculates sizes and spacing. Currently supports two operands joined by `+` or `-`, with spaces on both sides of the operator. Multiplication, division, and nested expressions are unsupported.

```css
.container {
  /* Viewport width minus both side margins */
  width: calc(100vw - 60rpx);
  margin: 0 auto;
}
```

Operands can be compatible lengths or two percentages. Ordinary sizes and spacing do not support mixed percentages and lengths such as `width: calc(100% - 20px)`. Use viewport lengths such as `calc(100vw - 20px)` or layout spacing instead.

### `var()`
Used to reference the value of a custom property, also known as a CSS variable.

```css
:root {
  --primary-color: #40FF5E;
}

.button {
  /* Use a variable with a fallback */
  background-color: var(--primary-color, #444);
}
```

## Random values with `random()`

`random()` generates values for supported numeric properties, such as decorative offsets, opacity, and animation duration. Use [Crypto](/AIUI/api/crypto) when you need secure random bytes.

```css
.spark {
  opacity: 0.8;
  opacity: random(0.4, 1);
  margin-left: random(-20px, 20px, 5px);
  animation-duration: random(400ms, 1s, 100ms);
}
```

### Syntax and ranges

```css
random(min, max)
random(min, max, step)
random(auto, min, max)
random(--key, min, max, step)
```

- `min` and `max` must be compatible literals: numbers, lengths, times, or percentages. Length units can be mixed, as can `ms` and `s`. Percentages cannot be mixed with lengths or unitless numbers.
- Optional `step` must be positive and compatible with the range. Discrete results are `min + n × step`; the upper bound is possible only when a step lands exactly on `max`. If `max < min`, the result is `min`.
- The receiving property determines the accepted type: numbers for `opacity`, lengths for `margin-left`, and times for `animation-duration`. Integer properties round the result, and each property's own limits still apply.
- Nested `calc()` / `random()` arguments and random angles, frequencies, and resolutions are unsupported. Invalid expressions invalidate the declaration; provide an ordinary value first as a fallback.

### Stable values and shared randomness

Random values are scoped to an element or generated pseudo-element. Recomputing styles does not resample them on every update. Omitting the first argument or using `auto` gives each function occurrence within a property its own sample.

A `--key` shares the random base within one element. Equal ranges and steps produce equal results; different ranges map the same base into their own ranges. Values are not shared across elements:

```css
.spark {
  width: random(--size, 4px, 10px, 2px);
  height: random(--size, 4px, 10px, 2px);
}
```

Random animation endpoints are resolved before interpolation and stay stable during that playback. Each event-triggered replay gets its own random context without changing retained older instances. Expressions in custom properties are resolved at the consuming property.

Cross-element sharing, `element-shared`, fixed random sources, and full browser random-cache semantics are not supported. See [Animations and transforms](/AIUI/framework/wxss-animation) for replay examples.

## 2. Visual Effects

### `linear-gradient()`
Creates a linear gradient background.

```css
.header {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #40FF5E 0%, #06a954 100%);
}
```

### `rgba()`
Defines a color with transparency.

```css
.mask {
  background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
}
```

## 3. Resource Inclusion

### `url()`
Used to include external resources. In WXSS, using a network path or base64 is recommended.

```css
.icon {
  background-image: url('https://res.rokid.com/static/icon.png');
  background-size: cover;
}
```

## 4. Geometric Transforms

### `translate()`, `rotate()`, `scale()`
Used together with the `transform` property to move, rotate, and scale elements.

```css
.active-item {
  transform: translateX(20rpx) scale(1.1);
}

.loading-spinner {
  animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes spin {
  from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
  to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}
```

---

*For the complete list of functions and detailed syntax, see [MDN CSS Functions](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_Functions).*

# 函数 (Functions)

CSS 函数被用作 CSS 属性的值，允许你在样式表中执行简单的计算、处理颜色或引用外部资源。WXSS 支持以下 CSS 函数子集，具体语法以本页为准。

以下是在 WXSS 开发中最常用的函数及其代码示例：

## 1. 计算与变量

### `calc()`
用于计算尺寸与间距。当前支持两个操作数之间的 `+` 或 `-`，运算符两侧必须留空格；不支持乘除或嵌套表达式。

```css
.container {
  /* 宽度为视口宽度减去两侧的边距 */
  width: calc(100vw - 60rpx);
  margin: 0 auto;
}
```

两个操作数可为兼容的长度或两个百分比。普通尺寸与间距不支持百分比和长度混合计算，例如 `width: calc(100% - 20px)`；使用视口长度 `calc(100vw - 20px)` 或布局间距替代。

### `var()`
用于引用自定义属性（CSS 变量）的值。

```css
:root {
  --primary-color: #40FF5E;
}

.button {
  /* 引用变量，并提供回退值 */
  background-color: var(--primary-color, #444);
}
```

## 随机值 `random()`

`random()` 为支持的数值属性生成随机值，适合装饰位置、透明度和动画时长。它不是安全随机数接口；需要安全随机字节时使用 [Crypto](/AIUI/api/crypto)。

```css
.spark {
  opacity: 0.8;
  opacity: random(0.4, 1);
  margin-left: random(-20px, 20px, 5px);
  animation-duration: random(400ms, 1s, 100ms);
}
```

### 语法与取值

```css
random(min, max)
random(min, max, step)
random(auto, min, max)
random(--key, min, max, step)
```

- `min`、`max` 必须是兼容类型的字面量：数字、长度、时间或百分比。不同长度单位可以混用；`ms` 与 `s` 可以混用；百分比不能与长度或无单位数字混用。
- `step` 可选，必须为正值且与区间类型兼容。离散结果为 `min + n × step`；仅当步长恰好落到 `max` 时才可能取到上界。`max < min` 时返回 `min`。
- 属性决定可接受的类型，例如 `opacity` 接受数字，`margin-left` 接受长度，`animation-duration` 接受时间。整数属性会将结果舍入，属性自身的范围限制仍然生效。
- 不支持嵌套 `calc()` / `random()` 参数，也不支持随机角度、频率和分辨率。无效表达式会使对应声明失效，建议先写普通值作为回退。

### 稳定性与共享随机值

随机值以元素或生成的伪元素为作用域，重新计算样式不会每次重新抽样。省略首个参数或使用 `auto` 时，每个属性中的每次函数调用独立取样。

同一元素上的 `--key` 共享随机基值。使用相同区间与步长可得到相同结果；区间不同则将同一基值映射到各自范围。它不在不同元素之间共享：

```css
.spark {
  width: random(--size, 4px, 10px, 2px);
  height: random(--size, 4px, 10px, 2px);
}
```

动画中的随机端点在插值前确定，并在该次播放期间保持稳定。每次事件触发的重播会获得独立的随机上下文，保留下来的旧实例不会改变。自定义属性中的表达式会在使用它的属性处解析。

当前支持范围不包含跨元素共享、`element-shared`、固定随机源或完整的浏览器随机缓存语义。动画重播示例见[动画与变换](/AIUI/framework/wxss-animation)。

## 2. 视觉效果

### `linear-gradient()`
创建线性渐变背景。

```css
.header {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #40FF5E 0%, #06a954 100%);
}
```

### `rgba()`
定义带透明度的颜色。

```css
.mask {
  background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
}
```

## 3. 资源引入

### `url()`
用于引入外部资源。在 WXSS 中建议使用网络路径或 base64。

```css
.icon {
  background-image: url('https://res.rokid.com/static/icon.png');
  background-size: cover;
}
```

## 4. 几何变换

### `translate()`, `rotate()`, `scale()`
配合 `transform` 属性实现元素的位移、旋转和缩放。

```css
.active-item {
  transform: translateX(20rpx) scale(1.1);
}

.loading-spinner {
  animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes spin {
  from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
  to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}
```

---

*完整的函数列表及其详细语法，请参考 [MDN CSS 函数](https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_Functions)。*

# WXSS Introduction

WXSS (WeiXin Style Sheets) is a style language used to describe component styles for AIUI agents.

AIUI follows the WXSS specification from WeChat Mini Programs. It is highly similar and compatible with standard CSS (Cascading Style Sheets). Most properties and usage described in the [MDN CSS Reference](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference) can be used directly in WXSS.

## WXSS Features

To better suit agent interfaces and mobile application development, WXSS adds a small number of extensions on top of CSS:

### 1. Size Unit `rpx`
`rpx` (responsive pixel) is a WXSS-specific responsive length unit. It adapts based on the screen width, and the screen width is defined as `480rpx`.

**Code example:**
```css
/* 在所有设备上，该视图将占据屏幕宽度的一半 */
.half-width-box {
  width: 240rpx;
  height: 100rpx;
  background-color: #40FF5E;
}
```

### 2. Style Import `@import`
The `@import` statement lets you conveniently import external stylesheets for modularity and reuse.

**Code example:**
```css
/** common.wxss **/
.text-danger {
  color: #ff4d4f;
}

/** index.wxss **/
@import "./common.wxss";

.title {
  font-size: 32rpx;
}
```

## Writing Recommendations

1. **Prefer class selectors**: For performance and maintainability, it is recommended to use `.class` selectors whenever possible.
2. **Avoid excessive nesting**: Deeply nested CSS selectors increase rendering overhead.
3. **Make good use of Flex layout**: AIUI's view engine provides strong underlying support for Flexbox, making it the preferred choice for building responsive interfaces.

By mastering standard CSS knowledge and understanding these features, you can easily build polished and adaptive AIUI interfaces.

# WXSS 介绍

WXSS (WeiXin Style Sheets) 是一套样式语言，用于描述 AIUI 智能体的组件样式。

AIUI 沿用了微信小程序的 WXSS 规范，它与标准的 CSS (层叠样式表) 具有极高的相似度和兼容性。大部分基于 [MDN CSS 参考](https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/CSS/Reference) 中的属性和用法，你都可以在 WXSS 中直接使用。

## WXSS 特性

为了更适合开发智能体界面与移动端应用，WXSS 在 CSS 的基础上进行了少量扩充：

### 1. 尺寸单位 `rpx`
`rpx` (responsive pixel) 是 WXSS 特有的响应式长度单位。它可以根据屏幕宽度进行自适应，规定屏幕宽为 `480rpx`。

**代码示例：**
```css
/* 在所有设备上，该视图将占据屏幕宽度的一半 */
.half-width-box {
  width: 240rpx;
  height: 100rpx;
  background-color: #40FF5E;
}
```

### 2. 样式导入 `@import`
使用 `@import` 语句可以方便地导入外联样式表，实现样式的模块化和复用。

**代码示例：**
```css
/** common.wxss **/
.text-danger {
  color: #ff4d4f;
}

/** index.wxss **/
@import "./common.wxss";

.title {
  font-size: 32rpx;
}
```

## 编写建议

1. **优先使用类选择器**：为了性能和可维护性，建议尽量使用 `.class` 选择器。
2. **避免过度嵌套**：过深的 CSS 选择器嵌套会增加渲染负担。
3. **善用 Flex 布局**：AIUI 的视图引擎对 Flexbox 提供了完美的底层支持，是构建响应式界面的首选。

通过掌握标准的 CSS 知识，并了解这几项特性，你就能轻松编写出漂亮且适配良好的智能体 UI 界面。

# Properties

WXSS supports the common properties below; its scope differs from browser CSS.

## 1. Layout and Positioning

### Flexbox Layout (Recommended)
Flex is the preferred layout method for agent interface development.

```css
.container {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column; /* 垂直排列 */
  justify-content: center; /* 水平居中 */
  align-items: center;     /* 垂直居中 */
  height: 400rpx;
}

.item {
  flex: 1; /* 自动撑满剩余空间 */
}
```

### Position
Used to precisely control where an element appears on the screen.

```css
.sticky-header {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
  z-index: 100;
}

.absolute-icon {
  position: absolute;
  right: 20rpx;
  bottom: 20rpx;
}
```

## 2. Box Model

### Size and Spacing
Controls the space occupied by an element.

```css
.box {
  width: 200rpx;
  height: 200rpx;
  margin: 20rpx auto; /* 上下20rpx，左右自动居中 */
  padding: 30rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box; /* 宽度包含 padding 和 border */
}
```

### Borders and Rounded Corners
Controls the border appearance of an element.

```css
.card {
  border: 1px solid #eee;
  border-radius: 12rpx; /* 圆角 */
  background-color: #fff;
}
```

## 3. Typography and Text

### Basic Text Styles

```css
.title {
  font-size: 36rpx;
  font-weight: bold;
  color: #333;
  text-align: center;
}
```

### Text Overflow Handling
Used to handle truncation of long text.

```css
.single-line-ellipsis {
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis; /* 单行超出显示省略号 */
}
```

## 4. Visuals and Decoration

### Shadows and Opacity

```css
.button {
  box-shadow: 0 4rpx 8rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  opacity: 0.9;
}
```

## 5. Animation and Interaction

### Transition

```css
.btn-hover {
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.btn-hover:active {
  transform: scale(0.95);
}
```

---

*For the complete CSS property dictionary and detailed descriptions, see [MDN CSS Reference](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference#properties).*

## Single-line ellipsis and independent borders

```css
.title {
  width: 200px;
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}
.card {
  border-top: 1px solid #444;
  border-right: 2px dashed #40ff5e;
  padding: calc(12px + 4rpx);
  color: #fff !important;
}
```

`text-overflow: ellipsis` applies to width-constrained single-line text; it does not implement multiline clamping. Each border side supports its own width, style, color, and shorthand. `!important` participates in cascade priority and can prevent keyframe overrides.

Sizes, margin / padding / gap, and insets accept supported `calc()` values. See [Functions](/AIUI/framework/wxss-function) for syntax limits and random values, and [Animations and transforms](/AIUI/framework/wxss-animation) for concurrent animations and events.

